# Sweep verdicts quote text rendered off live pages with real seeded data — an admin:users
# cell failing `content-rendered` would publish student names and emails into a public repo.
# The values are masked at the source too (scripts/qa-sweep.mjs), but the files stay local.
# qa-coverage-state.json is deliberately NOT ignored: it is the durable queue, and it carries
# only cell ids, timestamps and probe names.
qa-sweep-verdicts.json
qa-sweep-verdicts.filtered.json
.qa-coverage-state.lock
*.tmp
